Note on the underlying data. The surveillance inputs in data/ntep_trajectories.csv
are derived from the World Health Organization Global TB Programme country data
(https://extranet.who.int/tme/), which carry their own terms. The bibliographic
metadata in data/tb_interventions_unified.csv was harvested from PubMed and
Europe PMC. Please cite the original sources alongside this archive.
